00:17:16,885 --> 00:17:30,454
[SPEAKER_01]: So, if I never miss, never skip a beat, if my mindfulness is every second to a second, if I'm observing my thoughts clearly, constantly, evenly, all the time, suffering will diminish and I will not suffer.

