00:18:11,823 --> 00:18:19,068
[SPEAKER_01]: So, if you realize that the gateway of all of your problems, it's not like because your mindfulness skipped a beat.

215
00:18:19,748 --> 00:18:19,928
[SPEAKER_01]: No.

216
00:18:20,168 --> 00:18:23,891
[SPEAKER_01]: It's because your body, your speech, and your mind, still,

