00:18:29,588 --> 00:18:33,389
[SPEAKER_01]: And those actions of greed, aversion, delusion are not subconscious.

219
00:18:33,549 --> 00:18:40,650
[SPEAKER_01]: They're not kind of extra millisecond quick, where you must have developed this focus to spot them.

