00:18:57,767 --> 00:19:11,913
[SPEAKER_01]: And, as I said before, if anybody, like, you know, starts this this self-questioning, they will arrive at that point where they're clearly gonna see a compromise that they are aware of, that they are making, on account of which they try to compensate.

