00:19:32,057 --> 00:19:34,658
[SPEAKER_01]: That was the missing part for my aggregator virtue.

228
00:19:35,018 --> 00:19:44,920
[SPEAKER_01]: So, if I would have a day where there is nothing pressuring me, no major event that would be sort of pulling me for distraction, entertainment and so on, great!

229
00:19:45,040 --> 00:19:47,440
[SPEAKER_01]: So, I could spend the whole day then in a mindful state.

230
00:19:48,060 --> 00:19:49,140
[SPEAKER_01]: You don't need to do anything else.

231
00:19:49,500 --> 00:19:53,001
[SPEAKER_01]: Just keep an eye on that gateway.

232
00:19:53,021 --> 00:19:53,761
[SPEAKER_01]: Yeah, content.

233
00:19:54,541 --> 00:19:55,141
[SPEAKER_01]: Exactly.

234
00:19:55,402 --> 00:19:57,342
[SPEAKER_01]: And that's exactly the form of contentment.

235
00:19:57,943 --> 00:20:09,113
[SPEAKER_01]: But, if you ignore the fact that you're still making compromises on account of greed, aversion, distraction, then, everything else will become a compensation for it.

236
00:20:09,593 --> 00:20:13,356
