00:23:25,803 --> 00:23:26,604
[SPEAKER_01]: I do the same thing.

287
00:23:27,705 --> 00:23:37,452
[SPEAKER_01]: Now, on account of this pain and pressure, I will still not engage with anything unwholesome, including trying to get rid of this pain and pressure, because I'm so averse to it.

288
00:23:40,167 --> 00:23:43,609
[SPEAKER_01]: So, the principle remains unchanged, the practice remains the same.

289
00:23:43,629 --> 00:23:45,570
[SPEAKER_01]: What increases is the pressure on account of it.

